{
  "title": { "zh": "两条路都要" },
  "tray": "machine",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "对着「或者」，补充的左右两条规则都不会失败。<level-ref to=\"s-orelse\"></level-ref>里，<part-ref to=\"part:append\"></part-ref>只用第一个没失败的框，选错了也回不去。有了回溯，<part-ref to=\"part:append\"></part-ref>也给出所有结果：先是第一个框的每一种，再是下一个框的每一种。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "s-append",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "proved",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "目标" } }],
      "backtrack": true,
      "tests": [
        { "goal": "Rain ∨ Wind", "hyps": ["Wind"] },
        { "goal": "Rain ∨ Wind", "hyps": ["Rain"] },
        { "goal": "Wet ∨ Slip", "hyps": ["Slip"] }
      ],
      "brief": { "zh": "设计一个证明助手，证完每一个目标。" },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "补充的哪一边对，现在不必当场决定。"
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "c0 = append(in, first: c1, second: c2) {",
        "  first {",
        "    c1r0 = orI[use=[disjI1]]()",
        "    c1 = rule(c0.first, c1r0)",
        "  }",
        "  second {",
        "    c2r0 = orI[use=[disjI2]]()",
        "    c2 = rule(c0.second, c2r0)",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "c3 = assumption(c0)",
        "out <- c3"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
